step 1

Check SSH service

systemctl status ssh

(RHEL uses sshd.)

If it is stopped:

sudo systemctl start ssh

step 2
Check SSH logs

Ubuntu

tail -20 /var/log/auth.log

RHEL

tail -20 /var/log/secure

step 3
Check firewall

sudo ufw status

or

sudo firewall-cmd --list-all

step 4
Test connectivity

ping server-ip

step 5. 
Check SSH port

telnet server-ip 22
